#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/model-warmup.rst:195
msgid "The spec is immutable after creation; create another resource for another Once operation. Separate pipeline stages, arbitrary lifecycle hooks, workload or rollout gating, autoscaler mutation, and workload-derived targets remain out of scope. Custom actions are finite Job work, not a general-purpose deployment or orchestration framework."
msgstr "spec 创建后不可变；如需执行另一次 Once 操作，请创建新的资源。独立的流水线阶段、任意生命周期钩子、工作负载或发布门禁、自动扩缩容器变更，以及从工作负载派生目标，仍不在支持范围内。自定义操作是有限的 Job 工作，而非通用部署或编排框架。"
